<title>UNITED NATIONS: S. Korean U.N. envoy assumes council presidency.</title>
<headline>S. Korean U.N. envoy assumes council presidency.</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambassador Park Soo Gil of South Korea takes over as president of the Security Council on Thursday, succeeding ambassador Antonio Monteiro of Portugal.</p>
<p>The post rotates monthly according to the English alphabetical order of the council's 15 member states.</p>
</text>
